# checkout the naming file's [paths] scalar_go names, with the Rust release
# that tools.env pins for the host's archives.
# The engine stage does the same for the engine's archive (D58), which the
# runner links to open the engine on an engine database whose types compose
# behaviors the core's archive leaves out: the archive of the project's
# engine crate, which compiles them in, built from its ffi member beside the
